    - target: {fileID: 1339333832908758090, guid: 0a1b11437c878cd4b9b91c197c428b37, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _text._text
      value: Toujours pas... Il est vraiment costaud ! Plus solide que le mariage
        du Commi-
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1460789826923332410, guid: 0a1b11437c878cd4b9b91c197c428b37, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _text._text
      value: "Je vois que Damas a remplac\xE9 le poster que j\u2019ai trou\xE9 par<wait=0,25>.<wait=0,25>.<wait=0,25>.
        <wait=0,75>un poster de Patrice et moi ?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961747040624022441, guid: 0a1b11437c878cd4b9b91c197c428b37, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _text._text
      value: "A nous deux, maintenant que personne n\u2019est l\xE0..."
